{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0One Mission. One Hour. Infinite Trials\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0/////////</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An hour from now, the world will end. Your only chance is to board the enemy\u2019s ever-changing warship, fight through its defenses, and face what waits at the end. Assemble your squad and dive into a shifting, procedurally generated gauntlet filled with weapons, traps, and relentless machines. Every run is a desperate push toward the final showdown, and only teamwork will determine if you survive the last hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/94dc08a5f431ef727a50eb96a753713b.poster.avif?t=1759333210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/94dc08a5f431ef727a50eb96a753713b.webm?t=1759333210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/94dc08a5f431ef727a50eb96a753713b.mp4?t=1759333210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Your World VS One Boss\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0/////////</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you\u2019ve learned, every weapon you\u2019ve found, and every ability you\u2019ve mastered leads to this: the final hour\u2019s last battle. Face a towering foe of overwhelming power, endure chaotic battlefields of shifting hazards, and fight with everything you\u2019ve got. The fate of your world hangs on this fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/312b21f91403c9dc681b1bb2a3d37dcd.poster.avif?t=1759333210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/312b21f91403c9dc681b1bb2a3d37dcd.webm?t=1759333210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/312b21f91403c9dc681b1bb2a3d37dcd.mp4?t=1759333210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Join the INFINITE 100\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0/////////</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to go beyond the game? Join our Discord and become one of the INFINITE 100, an elite crew of heroes helping forge the future of <i>11th Hour Hero</i>. Swap stories, give feedback, and earn your place among the first legends of the last hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/dca9e35b8a757cc4a4be61934e9104c9.poster.avif?t=1759333210\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/dca9e35b8a757cc4a4be61934e9104c9.webm?t=1759333210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460990/extras/dca9e35b8a757cc4a4b