. Infinite trials. Gather your friends, choose your powers, and prepare for a final battle to decide the fate of the world. 11th Hour Hero is a multiplayer roguelike FPS where every choice in a shifting, procedural ship determines whether you rise in glory, or fall into defeat.","steam_appid":3460990,"support_info":{"email":"willfire19@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://11thhourhero.carrd.co/"}